    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm developing a small action adventure about a mouse in a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/5f749364909fe3913752c98cc97cbd5e.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Village</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Care is about rebuilding a withering village by bringing back the people who used to live there but went away to find something better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you grow up in a small town, the Idea of leaving might always be on your mind, but is there really anything &quot;better&quot; waiting for you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his game is about community and finding strength within it instead of abandoning it in search of something better for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/b03a9fa70d4595055ef3c7f2554de5fc.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a big forest with many different areas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new friends who lost their way somewhere on their journey and help them out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new gadgets that let you experience the forest in ever-changing ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own playstyle by choosing between different weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a plethora of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an original soundtrack by me :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with a controller is heavily recommended! (Mouse and Keyboard works too if you don't have one, but please get one.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/f15c87174f496aec0c0fdd7d73a30fa3.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made without any form of generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/637ba287c7894c36e27920eef543b92f.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm developing a small action adventure about a mouse in a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/5f749364909fe3913752c98cc97cbd5e.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Village</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Care is about rebuilding a withering village by bringing back the people who used to live there but went away to find something better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you grow up in a small town, the Idea of leaving might always be on your mind, but is there really anything &quot;better&quot; waiting for you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his game is about community and finding strength within it instead of abandoning it in search of something better for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/b03a9fa70d4595055ef3c7f2554de5fc.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a big forest with many different areas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new friends who lost their way somewhere on their journey and help them out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new gadgets that let you experience the forest in ever-changing ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own playstyle by choosing between different weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a plethora of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an original soundtrack by me :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with a controller is heavily recommended! (Mouse and Keyboard works too if you don't have one, but please get one.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/f15c87174f496aec0c0fdd7d73a30fa3.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made without any form of generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/637ba287c7894c36e27920eef543b92f.avif?t=1746364297\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In Take Care you discover a great forest full of challenging enemies and puzzles. Help rebuild a withering town in its center and bring back its inhabitants who have lost their way in search of something better.",
